        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jill Marie Jones, Sam Raimi, Ivan Raimi, Tom Spezialy, Bruce Campbell\n- TV Series: Ash vs Evil Dead\n- Networks: Starz\n- Franchises: Evil Dead\n- Roles: Amanda Fisher, Ash Williams\n\nFacts:\n- Jill Marie Jones was born on January 4, 1975, and she is an American actress, former professional dancer, and former cheerleader.\n- Ash vs Evil Dead is an American horror comedy television series developed for the Starz network by Sam Raimi, Ivan Raimi, and Tom Spezialy.\n- Ash vs Evil Dead is set in Sam Raimi's Evil Dead universe and serves as a sequel to the original Evil Dead trilogy.\n- Bruce Campbell reprised his role as Ash Williams in Ash vs Evil Dead.\n- From 2015 to 2016, Jill Marie Jones starred as Amanda Fisher in the Starz horror-comedy series Ash vs Evil Dead.",
